brand color, warm gold supplies a gift-wrap/premium accent, and the soft cream ground keeps the mark legible without a hard white box when the icon sits on light browser chrome or an app launcher."}, {"id": "public_favicon_single_stroke_motif", "label": "Single Continuous Stroke Motif", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "public/favicon.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The heart outline, the bow loops and the box edges are drawn as one unbroken calligraphic line so a single glyph says both 'gift' and 'heart' at once, matching the brand name. Line art (rather than a filled illustration) keeps the silhouette open and recognizable when scaled down to favicon size, though the fine strokes are the main legibility risk at 16px."}, {"id": "public_favicon_gift_as_affection_concept", "label": "Gift-as-Affection Brand Concept", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "public/favicon.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The name 'Coracao Presente' puns on presente (gift / present) and coracao (heart); the mark literalizes the pun by nesting a wrapped box inside a heart, so the visual identity and the verbal identity reinforce the same positioning for a gift shop."}, {"id": "public_favicon_app_icon_role", "label": "Favicon / PWA App Icon Role", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "public/favicon.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "File lives at public/favicon.png, the static asset root served verbatim, so this artwork is the browser tab icon and the installed-PWA launcher icon rather than in-page content."}], "edges": [{"source": "public_favicon_heart_gift_mark", "target": "public_favicon_brand_logo", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "public/favicon.png